rt ratings, and market pricing. Ratings services split between Likely Republican and Solid or Safe Republican, and prediction markets give Schmidt roughly an 80 percent chance of holding the seat.\n\nCoover has raised a notable sum for a challenger in this district, and recent national coverage points to a late environment drifting toward Democrats, which argues for some caution. Still, the incumbent's edge in cash on hand, the district's partisan lean, and the absence of any polling showing a contest all point the same direction. A Republican win is expected, with the main question being the size of the margin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0506, "margin": -10.48}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0308, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0524, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0445, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0597, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0512, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0416, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0318, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0398, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0406, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0253, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0744, "margin": -10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0619, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0457, "margin": -11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0427, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0316, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.038, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0474, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.0379, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0329, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0634, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0362, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0681, "margin": -10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 